### Option 6: Code Quality & Refactoring (Enhancement 013)

**Goal:** Improve codebase maintainability by restructuring API endpoints

**Current State:**
- `src/api/main.py` is **1,120 lines** with **23 endpoints** (bloated)
- Already using router pattern successfully (5 existing routers)
- Endpoint distribution: Chat (2), Conversations (3), Analytics (3), Enhancements (9 duplicate), Health (2), Root (1)

**Recommended Approach: Option 1 - Minimal Refactoring (Low Risk)**

**Tasks:**
1. **Create Chat Router** (45 min)
   - Extract `/api/chat` and `/api/chat/stream` endpoints
   - Move to `src/api/chat.py`
   - Include streaming SSE logic

2. **Create Conversations Router** (30 min)
   - Extract conversation management endpoints:
     - `/api/conversations`
     - `/api/conversations/{id}`
     - `/api/conversations/{id}/messages`
   - Move to `src/api/conversations.py`

3. **Create Analytics Router** (30 min)
   - Extract analytics endpoints:
     - `/api/analytics/summary`
     - `/api/analytics/tokens`
     - `/api/analytics/cost-breakdown`
   - Move to `src/api/analytics.py`

4. **Consolidate Enhancement Routes** (45 min)
   - Currently duplicated across:
     - `/api/enhancements/*` (generic)
     - `/api/ecommerce/enhancements/*` (project-specific)
     - `/api/sre-analytics/enhancements/*` (project-specific)
   - Design unified enhancement routing strategy
   - Update existing `src/api/enhancements.py` if needed

5. **Update Main.py** (30 min)
   - Include new routers: `app.include_router(chat_router)`
   - Keep only: Health, Providers, Root endpoints
   - Reduce from 1,120 lines to ~400 lines

6. **Test All Endpoints** (1 hour)
   - Verify all 23 endpoints still work
   - Test streaming SSE functionality
   - Check Prometheus metrics still collect
   - Validate CORS and middleware still apply

**Files Changed:** 4 new files + 1 modified
- `src/api/chat.py` (new)
- `src/api/conversations.py` (new)
- `src/api/analytics.py` (new)
- `src/api/main.py` (modified: 1,120 → ~400 lines)

**Estimated Time:** 3-4 hours

**Benefits:**
- ✅ Main.py reduced by 64% (1,120 → 400 lines)
- ✅ Clear separation of concerns
- ✅ Easier to test individual routers
- ✅ Follows FastAPI best practices (already proven with 5 existing routers)
- ✅ Prevents further endpoint bloat
- ✅ Improves code navigation and maintainability

**Risk Level:** **Low** (Router extraction is standard FastAPI refactoring)

**When to Do This:**
- ✅ **Now recommended** - main.py already past 800-line threshold
- Streaming implementation just added 200+ lines to main.py
- Will become harder to refactor as more endpoints added

**Success Criteria:**
- [ ] All 23 endpoints respond correctly
- [ ] Streaming SSE still works perfectly
- [ ] Prometheus metrics still collect
- [ ] Main.py under 500 lines
- [ ] No functional regressions
- [ ] Documentation updated

**Alternative: Option 2 - Moderate Refactoring** (defer until later)
- Split `src/database/repositories.py` (851 lines → 8 files)
- Rename `src/db/` → `src/db_enhancements/` for clarity
- Add README.md to both database directories
- **Estimated Time:** 4-6 hours
- **Risk:** Medium

**Verdict:** Database layer is acceptable as-is. Focus on main.py first.

